+/**
+ * Height from which the Ark-0 signet, the P2MR test network whose challenge is
+ * 5121026fc5d8e79a9fbc8bc3dea07d82641d16717ce0b000c13c512d8e8c1788c6e5da51ae,
+ * executes OP_CHECKMLDSA44 in P2MR leaves (doc/p2mr-mldsa44.md). It is a rule of
+ * that network, so it is fixed here rather than given by an option that two of its
+ * nodes could set differently. Set once, for the rollout of 2026-09-25; it does not
+ * change after a build carrying it has left the network's own nodes.
+ */
+inline constexpr int ARK0_MLDSA44_HEIGHT{8600};
+
